  "accepted_answers": ["1 December 1737"],
  "explanation": "The question asks for the death date of Louis Alexandre. Multiple sources provide conflicting dates: D2S3 and D3S1 clearly state that Louis Alexandre de Bourbon, comte de Toulouse, died on 1 December 1737. Document D4S5 mentions a 'last known count, Louis Alexandre, died on 15 June 1745,' but this appears to refer to a different title (count of Toulouse), not the individual Louis Alexandre de Bourbon. Additionally, D5S1 states a death date of 1 January 1738, but this seems to describe another person or is inconsistent with the rest of the evidence. Since D2S3 and D3S1 directly name Louis Alexandre de Bourbon and provide a consistent death date, this is the most reliable and specific claim."
